1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:12,200
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:40,600
[SCREAMING IN PAIN]

3
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:43,167
[TIRES SCREECHING]

4
00:00:45,033 --> 00:00:46,633
- [ENGINE REVVING]
- [TIRES SCREECHING]

5
00:00:55,533 --> 00:00:56,833
[TIRES SCREECH]

6
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:59,333
[ENGINE REVVING]

7
00:00:59,467 --> 00:01:00,767
[TRUCK HORN BLARES]

8
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:02,233
[LOUD CRASH]

9
00:01:02,367 --> 00:01:03,833
[TIRES SCREECHING]

10
00:01:05,633 --> 00:01:07,300
- Stop!
- [GUNSHOTS]

11
00:01:09,833 --> 00:01:11,467
[FIREWORKS EXPLODING]

12
00:01:13,067 --> 00:01:17,100
[METAL RODS CLANGING]

13
00:01:17,233 --> 00:01:19,167
- [ENGINE REVVING]
- [BUS HORN HONKS]

14
00:01:20,167 --> 00:01:21,567
[GLASS SHATTERING]

15
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:24,700
- [TIRES SCREECHING]
- [LOUD CRASH]

16
00:01:25,367 --> 00:01:28,067
[ENGINE REVVING]

17
00:01:29,233 --> 00:01:31,467
[TIRES SCREECHING]

18
00:01:32,733 --> 00:01:34,733
[TIRES SCREECHING]

19
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,100
[GUNSHOTS]

20
00:01:36,233 --> 00:01:37,500
[TIRES SCREECHING]

21
00:01:37,633 --> 00:01:38,733
- [TRUCK HORN HONKS]
- [LOUD CRASH]

22
00:01:38,867 --> 00:01:40,867
[TIRES SCREECHING]

23
00:01:45,233 --> 00:01:48,367
<i>- Victor, your money is ready!
- See you then.</i>

24
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:51,367
<i>He said he has a business
meeting at Jade Imperial.</i>

25
00:01:52,833 --> 00:01:54,000
<i> We need to get in.</i>

26
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,733
[METAL CLANKS]

27
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:58,733
[THUDS]

28
00:01:59,933 --> 00:02:00,567
[METAL DOOR CREAKS]

29
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:02,367
<i> Find a way to get in that bar.</i>

30
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:03,600
We should split up.

31
00:02:03,733 --> 00:02:06,200
<i>- Have you seen Mr. Chan?
- He's in the VIP room.</i>

32
00:02:06,333 --> 00:02:07,933
<i> Sir, are you alone?</i>

33
00:02:08,067 --> 00:02:09,267
<i> None of your business.</i>

34
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:12,067
<i>Are you sure about the job
we took? I'm getting nervous.</i>

35
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:14,600
<i> Don't let anyone else in here.</i>

36
00:02:14,767 --> 00:02:16,633
<i>We're almost there.
We have the item with us.</i>

37
00:02:18,667 --> 00:02:21,067
<i>These people don't look
like a small-time syndicate.</i>

38
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:23,300
<i> I hope the pay is worth it.</i>

39
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,567
<i>It seems like our lives
are at stake here, Gabo.</i>

40
00:02:29,433 --> 00:02:36,400
[UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING]

41
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,500
Here they are.

42
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:42,933
- Victor!
- Mr. Chan.

43
00:02:44,667 --> 00:02:46,000
(In Chinese) Happy New Year!

44
00:02:46,133 --> 00:02:47,333
Take a seat.

45
00:02:49,900 --> 00:02:51,000
[LUCAS] Mr. Chan.

46
00:02:51,467 --> 00:02:52,833
We brought your order.

47
00:02:53,233 --> 00:02:54,300
Easy, Lucas.

48
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,200
We aren't just here
to make a transaction.

49
00:02:58,700 --> 00:03:00,133
We are here to celebrate.

50
00:03:01,067 --> 00:03:02,067
[MR. CHAN] Good.

51
00:03:02,633 --> 00:03:03,900
I like your gold.

52
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:05,567
Very in demand.

53
00:03:05,967 --> 00:03:07,300
Big profit for me.

54
00:03:07,867 --> 00:03:11,233
Next time, I order double
people, no problem.

55
00:03:11,667 --> 00:03:13,167
Let's enjoy now.

56
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:14,833
Good. That's good to hear.

57
00:03:14,967 --> 00:03:16,700
This is a good start
for our year.

58
00:03:16,833 --> 00:03:19,633
Art, order the
most expensive liquor.

59
00:03:20,100 --> 00:03:22,100
- Let's get drunk.
- No need.

60
00:03:22,267 --> 00:03:23,500
[MR. CHAN] I will pay.

61
00:03:23,633 --> 00:03:24,533
On me.

62
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:26,267
- [FINGER SNAPS]
- Yes, boss?

63
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,867
- Get the most expensive liquor.
- [WAITER] Yes, boss.

64
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:36,033
[DARK MUSIC PLAYING]

65
00:03:51,067 --> 00:03:54,833
[DARK MUSIC CONTINUES]

66
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,167
[BOUNCER 1] Where are you going?

67
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,933
I'll just use the bathroom

68
00:04:01,733 --> 00:04:03,600
[BOUNCER 2] You can't be here!
Scram!

69
00:04:05,667 --> 00:04:06,567
Leave!

70
00:04:07,233 --> 00:04:08,700
I thought the bathroom
was here.

71
00:04:08,833 --> 00:04:10,200
[BOUNCER 2] Leave! Leave!

72
00:04:10,333 --> 00:04:16,933
[DARK MUSIC PLAYING]

73
00:04:17,067 --> 00:04:24,033
[UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING]

74
00:04:39,133 --> 00:04:41,400
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

75
00:04:41,533 --> 00:04:42,667
[WAITER] Excuse me, sir.

76
00:04:43,967 --> 00:04:45,133
[GABO] Tekla.

77
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:47,000
Where are you going?

78
00:04:47,133 --> 00:04:48,367
To the VIP area.

79
00:04:50,767 --> 00:04:52,067
You already know what to do.

80
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:53,800
Go ahead. Be careful.
Go ahead.

81
00:04:53,933 --> 00:04:54,633
Take care, okay?

82
00:04:54,767 --> 00:05:01,733
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

83
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,200
BOUNCER 1] Who is that for?

84
00:05:07,033 --> 00:05:08,767
It's for the VIPs.

85
00:05:10,967 --> 00:05:12,367
[BOUNCER 2] Okay. Come on.

86
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:19,500
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

87
00:05:30,467 --> 00:05:31,500
Hi.

88
00:05:32,700 --> 00:05:33,767
Yes, sir?

89
00:05:37,933 --> 00:05:39,033
Come sit with me.

90
00:05:42,233 --> 00:05:43,667
Do you need something else?

91
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:50,767
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

92
00:06:08,933 --> 00:06:09,967
[FINGER SNAPS]

93
00:06:14,667 --> 00:06:16,067
[MR. CHAN] Like what
we talked about.

94
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,633
200 million...

95
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:18,833
in cash.

96
00:06:18,967 --> 00:06:20,200
[THUDDING]

97
00:06:20,333 --> 00:06:21,967
Do I still have to count it?

98
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,667
No need.

99
00:06:24,133 --> 00:06:25,400
You trust me,

100
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:26,900
I trust you.

101
00:06:27,367 --> 00:06:30,333
Me, money, no problem.

102
00:06:30,467 --> 00:06:31,933
I have lots of money.

103
00:06:32,067 --> 00:06:33,767
Good thing we understand
each other.

104
00:06:44,867 --> 00:06:46,200
Wait, why are you here?

105
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:47,833
You're still here?

106
00:06:47,967 --> 00:06:49,633
Were you listening in
on our conversation?

107
00:06:51,433 --> 00:06:52,467
Victor.

108
00:06:52,733 --> 00:06:53,867
Don't worry about it.

109
00:06:54,233 --> 00:06:56,367
[TEKLA] That's right.
I'm good at listening.

110
00:06:56,500 --> 00:06:59,133
He told me to stay put
so, I'm just sitting here.

111
00:06:59,267 --> 00:07:01,267
And you two?
Why are you still here?

112
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,333
Huh?

113
00:07:03,733 --> 00:07:04,767
Get out.

114
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:06,000
Kick them out.

115
00:07:06,667 --> 00:07:08,000
- Wait, wait!
- She's with us, boss.

116
00:07:08,133 --> 00:07:10,267
Wait, me too?! [GROANS]

117
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:11,733
[GOON] Let's go, let's go!

118
00:07:11,867 --> 00:07:13,667
- Come on, move.
- [TEKLA] Ouch!

119
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,833
- [IPE] Ow!
- [GOON] Get out!

120
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,300
- Get out!
- Boss, wait a second!

121
00:07:16,433 --> 00:07:18,367
- Get out of here!
- Hey, be gentle with her!

122
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:20,133
- Ow! [SHRIEKS] Ack!
- Out!

123
00:07:20,267 --> 00:07:24,767
- [THUDDING]
- [GROANING IN PAIN]

124
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:26,300
That hurt!

125
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,800
Gabo! [GROANS]

126
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:30,300
- [PANTING]
- What happened?

127
00:07:30,433 --> 00:07:32,233
Looks like they caught on.

128
00:07:32,367 --> 00:07:33,633
They kicked us out.

129
00:07:33,967 --> 00:07:34,867
But Gabo,

130
00:07:35,167 --> 00:07:36,067
we sniffed something out!

131
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:38,400
They have a huge transaction
going on inside!

132
00:07:38,533 --> 00:07:41,967
Gabo, Mr. Chan
and Tiger's transaction...

133
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:46,367
is worth millions of pesos
and gold, right?!

134
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:49,067
Are we finally gonna make it?
Are we gonna make it big?!

135
00:07:49,867 --> 00:07:50,867
We have a problem though.

136
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,700
There are tons of bodyguards!

137
00:07:52,833 --> 00:07:54,500
And they're jacked too!

138
00:07:54,633 --> 00:07:56,933
Looks like we're in a pinch,
Gabo.

139
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,833
We'll only die if we try
to catch them right now.

140
00:08:02,333 --> 00:08:03,567
I'll take care of it.

141
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:07,300
I'll find a way
to capture Tiger.

142
00:08:10,267 --> 00:08:11,533
[UWAK] Hopia!

143
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:14,100
- From Chinatown!
- [GROANS]

144
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:15,733
Hey.

145
00:08:15,867 --> 00:08:18,033
We went to Chinatown.

146
00:08:18,167 --> 00:08:19,800
Gabo is nowhere to be found.

147
00:08:19,933 --> 00:08:22,500
I'm certain
that with how crowded it is,

148
00:08:22,667 --> 00:08:24,033
you just didn't notice him.

149
00:08:24,167 --> 00:08:25,433
With how crowded it is,

150
00:08:25,567 --> 00:08:29,267
he wouldn't be able
to find Tiger or even catch him.

151
00:08:30,067 --> 00:08:32,467
You two are always
doubting Gabo.

152
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,200
Can't you put
a little faith in him?

153
00:08:34,533 --> 00:08:35,933
You know, Tomas,

154
00:08:36,233 --> 00:08:38,833
with how long we've been
watching Gabo,

155
00:08:38,967 --> 00:08:41,500
I'm a hundred percent sure
that he's gonna fail.

156
00:08:41,633 --> 00:08:43,933
Can't you believe in him?
Let's bet on it!

157
00:08:44,067 --> 00:08:45,267
Let's have a bet!

158
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:47,600
He'll capture Tiger!

159
00:08:47,733 --> 00:08:49,433
- For how much?
- Alright!

160
00:08:49,567 --> 00:08:50,767
- I'm down!
- Name your price.

161
00:08:50,900 --> 00:08:54,033
- 5,000 pesos!
- [LAUGHTER]

162
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,600
And here I thought
you believe in him!

163
00:08:56,933 --> 00:08:58,267
5,000 pesos?

164
00:08:58,400 --> 00:09:00,567
- Here. 20,000 pesos.
- Alright! Twenty!

165
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:01,800
- Here.
- Deal!

166
00:09:01,933 --> 00:09:03,033
- Best friend.
- Call!

167
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:04,267
Wait, wait, wait.

168
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:05,600
Who'll handle the money?

169
00:09:05,733 --> 00:09:07,700
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

170
00:09:07,833 --> 00:09:08,967
- It's Pops!
- Pops!

171
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:13,067
I don't know about you
but for me, I'm certain

172
00:09:13,567 --> 00:09:15,733
that Gabo will succeed.

173
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:27,833
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

174
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,167
I really like the quality
of your gold.

175
00:09:30,300 --> 00:09:32,200
Next week we will deliver
more gold.

176
00:09:32,333 --> 00:09:34,033
I will look forward to that.

177
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:35,933
- (In Chinese) Thank you.
- [CLAPS]

178
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,300
They're coming.

179
00:09:43,433 --> 00:09:50,367
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

180
00:09:57,367 --> 00:10:04,367
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC INTENSIFIES]

181
00:10:07,867 --> 00:10:09,333
- Let's move.
- Yeah.

182
00:10:09,733 --> 00:10:10,967
Keep it on the low.

183
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:25,700
- [SAM] Excuse me.
- Hey!

184
00:10:25,833 --> 00:10:27,167
[THUDDING] Ow!

185
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,467
- [TEKLA GROANS]
- I'm so sorry!

186
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,100
- [GABO] Watch it!
- Miss.

187
00:10:31,367 --> 00:10:33,167
- You?!
- You again?!

188
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,267
What do you mean, "again"?!

189
00:10:35,433 --> 00:10:36,800
[SAM] Are you stalking me?!

190
00:10:36,933 --> 00:10:38,833
[GABO] And why would I do that?!

191
00:10:38,967 --> 00:10:40,367
Maybe it's you
who's stalking me!

192
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:41,567
[SAM] Have some shame!

193
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:44,100
- Don't forget. You violated me!
- Hey!

194
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:45,767
It was you who violated me!

195
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:47,200
Didn't you kiss me?!

196
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,100
Scumbag!

197
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,667
- What now, huh?
- Sa-- Sam!

198
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,233
Want me to kiss you again, huh?

199
00:10:54,967 --> 00:10:56,100
I'll really do it.

200
00:10:57,233 --> 00:10:58,633
- [BLOW LANDS]
- Gabo!

201
00:10:58,767 --> 00:11:00,300
- [BONG] Gabo!
- [THUDDING]

202
00:11:00,433 --> 00:11:01,333
[GABO GRUNTS]

203
00:11:01,467 --> 00:11:05,467
[PEOPLE CLAMORING]

204
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,733
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

205
00:11:06,867 --> 00:11:08,333
Scoundrel! Do you know him?

206
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:10,633
Th-- that's the bastard
who stole a kiss from me!

207
00:11:10,767 --> 00:11:12,233
That bastard!

208
00:11:12,367 --> 00:11:13,767
- Hey! Enough!
- Seb!

209
00:11:13,900 --> 00:11:16,600
[PEOPLE CLAMORING]

210
00:11:16,733 --> 00:11:17,967
- [KICK LANDS]
- [GRUNTS]

211
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:20,600
- Get up!
- Gabo, fight back!

212
00:11:20,733 --> 00:11:21,600
You bastard...

213
00:11:21,733 --> 00:11:24,333
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [GABO GRUNTING]

214
00:11:24,467 --> 00:11:26,200
- [KAREN] Sir! Stop!
- Seb, that's enough!

215
00:11:26,333 --> 00:11:27,867
[BLOWS LANDING]

216
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,167
[THUDDING]

217
00:11:29,300 --> 00:11:33,300
[PEOPLE CLAMORING]

218
00:11:33,433 --> 00:11:35,400
- Seb!
- [FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING]

219
00:11:35,533 --> 00:11:36,733
- [BONG] Gabo!
- [KICK LANDS]

220
00:11:37,667 --> 00:11:39,033
[TEKLA] Gabo, fight back!

221
00:11:39,167 --> 00:11:40,233
Seb, stop it!

222
00:11:40,367 --> 00:11:41,700
- [BLOW LANDS]
- [TEKLA] Gabo!

223
00:11:42,700 --> 00:11:43,733
[GABO SHOUTS]

224
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:46,033
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [SEBASTIAN GRUNTING]

225
00:11:46,167 --> 00:11:47,633
- Get him, Gabo!
- Hell yeah!

226
00:11:47,767 --> 00:11:48,667
- That's it!
- Seb!

227
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:50,533
[BLOWS LANDING]

228
00:11:50,667 --> 00:11:51,733
[GUN COCKS]

229
00:11:52,100 --> 00:11:53,867
[SCREAMS] A gun!

230
00:11:55,267 --> 00:11:56,533
You bastard!

231
00:11:56,667 --> 00:11:58,633
- Whoa, whoa, whoa!
- He's got a gun!

232
00:12:00,267 --> 00:12:02,333
Want me to blow your head
into smithereens?

233
00:12:03,667 --> 00:12:05,367
Do you know
that I'm an NCIA agent?!

234
00:12:05,500 --> 00:12:12,467
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

235
00:12:15,867 --> 00:12:19,033
[SEBASTIAN] You idiot!
Want me to blow your brains out?

236
00:12:19,033 --> 00:12:21,533
Don't you that I'm NCIA? Huh?!

237
00:12:21,533 --> 00:12:23,000
[KAREN] You just blew our cover.

238
00:12:24,400 --> 00:12:26,933
This is the NCIA!
Victor Zafra, hands in the air!

239
00:12:26,933 --> 00:12:28,967
[GUNSHOTS]

240
00:12:28,967 --> 00:12:29,967
- Gabo!
- Gabo!

241
00:12:31,133 --> 00:12:32,200
Fall back!

242
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:35,333
[PEOPLE SCREAMING]

243
00:12:35,333 --> 00:12:42,267
[GUNSHOTS]

244
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:45,033
Gabo!

245
00:12:45,033 --> 00:12:46,367
- Gabo!
- [BINOY] Gabo!

246
00:12:46,367 --> 00:12:49,800
[GUNSHOTS]

247
00:12:49,833 --> 00:12:51,267
[ARTURO] You have
to get out, Victor!

248
00:12:51,267 --> 00:12:54,133
[GUNSHOTS]

249
00:12:54,133 --> 00:12:55,800
[SEBASTIAN] Come on!
Let's follow them!

250
00:12:55,800 --> 00:13:02,767
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

251
00:13:06,367 --> 00:13:09,000
[VICTOR] Hurry!
Let's split, quick!

252
00:13:09,933 --> 00:13:10,933
Move!

253
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:14,300
Faster! Open it, open it,
open it. Faster!

254
00:13:14,300 --> 00:13:16,367
Go. Let's go.
