[SAM] Stop!

502
00:27:37,533 --> 00:27:42,100
[GUNSHOTS]

503
00:27:46,200 --> 00:27:48,300
Victor Zafra,
you're under arrest.

504
00:27:49,767 --> 00:27:51,400
- [SAM] Cuff him.
- [SEBASTIAN] Get up!

505
00:27:53,833 --> 00:27:58,100
[HANDCUFFS RATTLING]

506
00:27:59,300 --> 00:28:00,267
Walk.

507
00:28:00,400 --> 00:28:05,133
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

508
00:28:05,267 --> 00:28:07,833
There goes our money.

509
00:28:09,100 --> 00:28:10,833
<i>You're going to be
an action star!</i>

510
00:28:10,967 --> 00:28:12,167
<i> I have a job for you.</i>

511
00:28:12,300 --> 00:28:13,867
<i>Let's just kill him off.
Easy.</i>

512
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:15,267
What is this woman doing here?!

513
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:17,100
<i>Do you know
what Gabo did to us?!</i>

514
00:28:17,800 --> 00:28:20,600
<i> It's so humiliating!</i>

515
00:28:20,733 --> 00:28:24,600
<i>Do we have to
grovel and beg</i>

516
00:28:24,767 --> 00:28:26,400
<i> in order to survive?</i>

517
00:28:26,533 --> 00:28:27,933
- [SNIFFLES]
- [FLATLINES]

518
00:28:28,067 --> 00:28:29,633
<i>- Pa!
- I need your help.</i>

519
00:28:30,733 --> 00:28:33,667
<i>My father is in the hospital.
I need money.</i>

520
00:28:33,800 --> 00:28:35,800
<i>There are plenty
of missions I can give you.</i>

521
00:28:35,933 --> 00:28:39,667
<i> Bring me Mr. Chan's gold bars.</i>

522
00:28:40,433 --> 00:28:42,633
<i>It doesn't matter
if he's dead or alive.</i>

523
00:28:42,767 --> 00:28:43,933
- [THWACKS]
<i> - Ah!</i>

524
00:28:46,433 --> 00:28:48,200
<i> I saw the news about your son.</i>

525
00:28:48,333 --> 00:28:49,767
<i>Yes, your daughter
arrested him.</i>

526
00:28:49,900 --> 00:28:50,933
<i> I didn't do anything to you.</i>

527
00:28:51,067 --> 00:28:53,633
<i>This can ruin our
good relationship, Ricardo.</i>

528
00:28:53,767 --> 00:28:57,133
- [GRUNTING]
- [BLOWS LANDING]

529
00:28:57,300 --> 00:28:59,000
<i> Just tell us who that guy is.</i>

530
00:28:59,900 --> 00:29:01,967
<i> I had a buyer for that bike!</i>

531
00:29:02,100 --> 00:29:05,267
<i>We could've used that money
for your father's operation!</i>

532
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:08,167
<i>If the patient doesn't
get immediate surgery,</i>

533
00:29:08,300 --> 00:29:10,633
<i> he might not make it.</i>

534
00:29:10,767 --> 00:29:12,600
We're racing against time here.

535
00:29:14,567 --> 00:29:16,133
<i> Gabo! Help!</i>

536
00:29:16,967 --> 00:29:20,333
- [GRUNTING, GROANING]
- [BLOWS LANDING]

537
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:22,367
<i> Where can I find Mr. Chan?</i>

538
00:29:22,500 --> 00:29:23,900
<i> We're making our move tonight.</i>

539
00:29:24,033 --> 00:29:27,067
<i>I need to find that guy
who meddled with our operation.</i>

540
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:29,733
<i> We'll silence Mr. Chan.</i>

541
00:29:29,900 --> 00:29:31,967
<i>- The Zafras are attacking!
- [GUNSHOTS]</i>

542
00:29:32,100 --> 00:29:34,333
[BLOWS LANDING]

543
00:29:34,467 --> 00:29:35,767
<i> Boss!</i>

544
00:29:35,900 --> 00:29:36,867
<i> - Ugh!
</i>- [THWACKS]

545
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:38,967
- [BLOWS LANDING]
<i> - Who are you?!</i>

546
00:29:39,100 --> 00:29:40,367
[BLOWS LANDING]

547
00:29:42,700 --> 00:29:44,800
- [GUNSHOT]
<i> - Let's get out of here!</i>
